 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 42240,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Log-addition correction, 1,280 entries for a difference d of two logs below 5.0 (index d, page $A5 plus d's whole part): 256 * log2(1 + 2^(-d/256)) less 1, from $FF down to $0A. log_add_mag adds it, plus one, to the larger log. MAIN's base entry at $A49A calls SEG1 at addresses inside it (s_A54E and the others): at a base SEG1 is loaded here instead"
  },
  {
   "address": 42318,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Byte 78 of the log-addition table in flight; at a base SEG1's routine called from $A4CE"
  },
  {
   "address": 42333,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Byte 93 of the log-addition table in flight; at a base SEG1's routine called from $A4AA"
  },
  {
   "address": 42357,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Byte 117 of the log-addition table in flight; at a base SEG1's routine called from $A4CB"
  },
  {
