   "type": "line",
   "text": "Byte 132 of the log-addition table in flight; at a base SEG1's routine called from $A4D1"
  },
  {
   "address": 42611,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Byte 371 of the log-addition table in flight; at a base SEG1's flag that ends the base loop at $A4DF when nonzero"
  },
  {
   "address": 42612,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Byte 372 of the log-addition table in flight; at a base SEG1's routine the base loop calls each pass ($A4E2)"
  },
  {
   "address": 42752,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "log_add_table from difference 2.0: the base address in log_add_mag's ADC at $B3C6, whose high byte (at $B3C8) is set to $A5-$A9 by the difference's whole part"
  },
